{"id":"0413066aa327a245","group":"89","path":"89/89-lem-glb-normal-box-reduction.md","title":"Box Reduction of GLB Normal Clauses","display":"lem-glb-normal-box-reduction — Box Reduction of GLB Normal Clauses","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-lem-glb-normal-box-reduction","aliases":["89-lem-glb-normal-box-reduction"],"display":"lem-glb-normal-box-reduction — Box Reduction of GLB Normal Clauses","depends_on":["[[89-df-glb-letterless-normal-form]]","[[89-lem-small-ordinal-operations]]","[[89-lem-glb-ordinal-truncation]]","[[89-lem-glb-second-box-boolean]]","[[89-df-glb-logic]]"],"created":"2026-10-05","revised":"2026-10-09"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-lem-glb-normal-box-reduction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-lem-glb-normal-box-reduction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-glb-normal-box-reduction — Box Reduction of GLB Normal Clauses"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e82c18eddcbe3ca2\" href=\"?note=e82c18eddcbe3ca2\" title=\"89-df-glb-letterless-normal-form\">89-df-glb-letterless-normal-form</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b21577b9c610fde4\" href=\"?note=b21577b9c610fde4\" title=\"89-lem-small-ordinal-operations\">89-lem-small-ordinal-operations</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"34a172f6f4cae8dd\" href=\"?note=34a172f6f4cae8dd\" title=\"89-lem-glb-ordinal-truncation\">89-lem-glb-ordinal-truncation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"fb1c292712c7fb27\" href=\"?note=fb1c292712c7fb27\" title=\"89-lem-glb-second-box-boolean\">89-lem-glb-second-box-boolean</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5a9efa2261b8f73c\" href=\"?note=5a9efa2261b8f73c\" title=\"89-df-glb-logic\">89-df-glb-logic</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-09"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\in\\mathcal O_\\infty\">\\(\\alpha\\in\\mathcal O_\\infty\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\\in\\mathcal O\">\\(\\beta\\in\\mathcal O\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in J\">\\(i\\in J\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\">\\(j\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\)</span>。记录须满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C_B\">\\(\\mathcal C_B\\)</span> 的全部条件。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F,G\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}\">\\(F,G\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta+1\">\\(\\beta+1\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta^{+j}\">\\(\\beta^{+j}\\)</span> 取已定义的有限码运算。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}glb\\text{-}normal\\text{-}box\\text{-}reduction}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nF\\equiv_B G&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow(F\\leftrightarrow G)\\in\\mathrm{GLB},\\\\\n(1,\\alpha,i)\\in\\mathcal C_B&amp;\\Longrightarrow\n[\\Box_0\\Phi(1,\\alpha,i)\\equiv_B H_0\\land\n\\Box_1\\Phi(1,\\alpha,i)\\equiv_B(\\neg H_\\alpha\\lor C_1)],\\\\\n(2,\\alpha,\\beta,i)\\in\\mathcal C_B&amp;\\Longrightarrow\n[\\Box_0\\Phi(2,\\alpha,\\beta,i)\\equiv_B H_{\\beta+1}\\land\n\\Box_1\\Phi(2,\\alpha,\\beta,i)\\equiv_B(\\neg H_\\alpha\\lor H_\\beta\\lor C_1)],\\\\\n(3,\\alpha,\\beta,i,j)\\in\\mathcal C_B&amp;\\Longrightarrow\n[\\Box_0\\Phi(3,\\alpha,\\beta,i,j)\\equiv_B H_{\\beta^{+j}}\\land\n\\Box_1\\Phi(3,\\alpha,\\beta,i,j)\\equiv_B(\\neg H_\\alpha\\lor H_\\beta\\lor C_{j+1})].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}glb\\text{-}normal\\text{-}box\\text{-}reduction}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nF\\equiv_B G&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow(F\\leftrightarrow G)\\in\\mathrm{GLB},\\\\\n(1,\\alpha,i)\\in\\mathcal C_B&amp;\\Longrightarrow\n[\\Box_0\\Phi(1,\\alpha,i)\\equiv_B H_0\\land\n\\Box_1\\Phi(1,\\alpha,i)\\equiv_B(\\neg H_\\alpha\\lor C_1)],\\\\\n(2,\\alpha,\\beta,i)\\in\\mathcal C_B&amp;\\Longrightarrow\n[\\Box_0\\Phi(2,\\alpha,\\beta,i)\\equiv_B H_{\\beta+1}\\land\n\\Box_1\\Phi(2,\\alpha,\\beta,i)\\equiv_B(\\neg H_\\alpha\\lor H_\\beta\\lor C_1)],\\\\\n(3,\\alpha,\\beta,i,j)\\in\\mathcal C_B&amp;\\Longrightarrow\n[\\Box_0\\Phi(3,\\alpha,\\beta,i,j)\\equiv_B H_{\\beta^{+j}}\\land\n\\Box_1\\Phi(3,\\alpha,\\beta,i,j)\\equiv_B(\\neg H_\\alpha\\lor H_\\beta\\lor C_{j+1})].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 16 章 pp.216–217，Stage 2。印刷页 p 对应 PDF 第 p+39 页。</p>\n<p>每行是有约束的全称等价式；表头 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_B\">\\(\\equiv_B\\)</span> 的右侧为对应盒的等价公式，不是裸公式断言。</p>\n<p>第一盒：第一类约化为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box_0\\bot\">\\(\\Box_0\\bot\\)</span>；第二类在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta+1\\le\\alpha\">\\(\\beta+1\\le\\alpha\\)</span> 条件下用 Löb 约化为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box_0H_\\beta=H_{\\beta+1}\">\\(\\Box_0H_\\beta=H_{\\beta+1}\\)</span>；第三类用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\ge\\beta^{+j}\">\\(\\alpha\\ge\\beta^{+j}\\)</span>、截断引理及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\beta^{+j})^{-(j+1)}\\le\\beta\">\\((\\beta^{+j})^{-(j+1)}\\le\\beta\\)</span>，消去指数项后应用 Löb 得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_{\\beta^{+j}}\">\\(H_{\\beta^{+j}}\\)</span>。完整逐式演算见原书 pp.216–217 Stage 2。</p>\n<p>第二盒：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_\\alpha\">\\(H_\\alpha\\)</span> 是第一盒公式，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_\\infty=\\top\">\\(H_\\infty=\\top\\)</span> 也是其布尔组合；套布尔保留引理。前两类中第二盒对负迭代底的作用约化为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_1\">\\(C_1\\)</span>；第三类用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&gt;j\">\\(i&gt;j\\)</span> 约化为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_{j+1}\">\\(C_{j+1}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>对空正规合取，两盒的结果均为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\top\">\\(\\top\\)</span>；对非空合取按 K 分配。此表附带全部侧条件，不允许对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i=j\">\\(i=j\\)</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\le\\beta\">\\(\\alpha\\le\\beta\\)</span> 的第三类乱套转换。短引理引用原书演算；没有宣称仅凭小模型计算证明 GLB。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-glb-letterless-normal-form","status":"resolved","id":"e82c18eddcbe3ca2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-glb-letterless-normal-form]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-lem-small-ordinal-operations","status":"resolved","id":"b21577b9c610fde4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-lem-small-ordinal-operations]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-lem-glb-ordinal-truncation","status":"resolved","id":"34a172f6f4cae8dd","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-lem-glb-ordinal-truncation]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-lem-glb-second-box-boolean","status":"resolved","id":"fb1c292712c7fb27","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-lem-glb-second-box-boolean]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-glb-logic","status":"resolved","id":"5a9efa2261b8f73c","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-glb-logic]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\alpha\\in\\mathcal O_\\infty","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta\\in\\mathcal O","display":false},{"tex":"i\\in J","display":false},{"tex":"j\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C_B","display":false},{"tex":"F,G\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta+1","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta^{+j}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}glb\\text{-}normal\\text{-}box\\text{-}reduction}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nF\\equiv_B G&\\Longleftrightarrow(F\\leftrightarrow G)\\in\\mathrm{GLB},\\\\\n(1,\\alpha,i)\\in\\mathcal C_B&\\Longrightarrow\n[\\Box_0\\Phi(1,\\alpha,i)\\equiv_B H_0\\land\n\\Box_1\\Phi(1,\\alpha,i)\\equiv_B(\\neg H_\\alpha\\lor C_1)],\\\\\n(2,\\alpha,\\beta,i)\\in\\mathcal C_B&\\Longrightarrow\n[\\Box_0\\Phi(2,\\alpha,\\beta,i)\\equiv_B H_{\\beta+1}\\land\n\\Box_1\\Phi(2,\\alpha,\\beta,i)\\equiv_B(\\neg H_\\alpha\\lor H_\\beta\\lor C_1)],\\\\\n(3,\\alpha,\\beta,i,j)\\in\\mathcal C_B&\\Longrightarrow\n[\\Box_0\\Phi(3,\\alpha,\\beta,i,j)\\equiv_B H_{\\beta^{+j}}\\land\n\\Box_1\\Phi(3,\\alpha,\\beta,i,j)\\equiv_B(\\neg H_\\alpha\\lor H_\\beta\\lor C_{j+1})].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\equiv_B","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box_0\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta+1\\le\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box_0H_\\beta=H_{\\beta+1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha\\ge\\beta^{+j}","display":false},{"tex":"(\\beta^{+j})^{-(j+1)}\\le\\beta","display":false},{"tex":"H_{\\beta^{+j}}","display":false},{"tex":"H_\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"H_\\infty=\\top","display":false},{"tex":"C_1","display":false},{"tex":"i>j","display":false},{"tex":"C_{j+1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\top","display":false},{"tex":"i=j","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha\\le\\beta","display":false}],"bytes":2563,"backlinks":[{"id":"0dd13695a736e1f7","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"17034fdfe7fbba71","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-212","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"正规化：[[89-df-glb-letterless-normal-form]] → [[89-lem-glb-nice-normalization]] → [[89-lem-glb-second-box-boolean]] → [[89-lem-glb-normal-box-reduction]] → [[89-thm-glb-letterless-normal-form]] → [[89-cor-glb-letterless-truth-decision]]。算例：[[89-ex-glb-normal-form-reduction]]。"}],"outgoing":["e82c18eddcbe3ca2","b21577b9c610fde4","34a172f6f4cae8dd","fb1c292712c7fb27","5a9efa2261b8f73c"]}